<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $0.50-0.75 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $0.50-0.75 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $0.75 lower. Top $55.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    55.25-55.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    54.00-54.75</p>
<p>Sows - off $0.50-1.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-450 lbs    45.00-46.00, mostly 45.00-45.50</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
</text>
